Error in `$<-.data.frame`(`*tmp*`, "stationDir", value = "D:/Fieldwork/Cameratrap recs/Fieldtrip 4 (Guilherme)/Plot_31/Trichillia 1") : replacement has 1 row, data has 0 In addition: Warning message:
