Hi,
Please share the exact code you used and where the error occurred.
In the current code the cameraOperation function is on the same line a a closing parenthesis of detectionHistory.
Also camera operation should be created before detection history.

Please also use the google group for questions. Make sure you share the str() of the relevant objects (camera trap table, record table, camera operation matrix). That will make it a bit easier to find the problem. The current information are not sufficient to help you.
Best regards,
Jürgen

