Hello,
it fails because the values in column "DateTimeOriginal" are dates only, without time information. Since you have the Time column you can restore proper Date/time:

datarecord$DateTimeOriginal <- paste(datarecord$Date, datarecord$Time)

Also change
                          recordDateTimeFormat = "ymd",
to

                          recordDateTimeFormat = "ymd HMS",

Best regards,
Jürgen

